---
title: "Unconference"
layout: base.njk
description: "Propose a workshop or session at Kin-Fusion Campout 2026 — a participant-led unconference on Saltspring Island."
---
<div class="container">
  <h1>Propose a Workshop</h1>

  <p>Kin-Fusion is an <strong>unconference</strong> — the schedule is built by participants. Anyone can propose a session: a movement workshop, a musical jam, a discussion circle, a skills exchange, or anything you'd like to share with the community.</p>

  <h2>How It Works</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Submit your proposal below (or at registration time)</li>
    <li>We compile proposals and share them before the event</li>
    <li>The final schedule is set collaboratively on-site at the opening session</li>
  </ol>

  <p>Sessions can be 30, 60, or 90 minutes. We'll have space for movement workshops, discussion circles, skill-shares, and more.</p>

  <noscript>
    <div class="noscript-notice">
      <p>The proposal form requires JavaScript. If you are unable to use JavaScript, please <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">email your proposal</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </noscript>

  <form id="unconference-form" novalidate aria-label="Workshop proposal">
    <!-- Honeypot -->
    <div class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true">
      <label for="website-hp-unc">Leave this blank</label>
      <input type="text" name="website" id="website-hp-unc" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
    </div>

    <fieldset>
      <legend>About you</legend>

      <div class="field">
        <label for="proposerName">Your name <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
        <input type="text" id="proposerName" name="proposerName" required aria-required="true"
               maxlength="100" autocomplete="name">
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label for="email">Email address <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
        <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required aria-required="true"
               autocomplete="email" aria-describedby="email-help">
        <p id="email-help" class="field-help">We'll send your reference code here</p>
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label for="pronouns">Pronouns (optional)</label>
        <input type="text" id="pronouns" name="pronouns" maxlength="50"
               placeholder="e.g. they/them, she/her" autocomplete="off">
      </div>
    </fieldset>

    <fieldset>
      <legend>Your proposal</legend>

      <div class="field">
        <label for="workshopTitle">Session title <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
        <input type="text" id="workshopTitle" name="workshopTitle" required aria-required="true"
               maxlength="200" aria-describedby="title-help">
        <p id="title-help" class="field-help">Max 200 characters</p>
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label for="description">Description <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
        <textarea id="description" name="description" required aria-required="true"
                  maxlength="500" rows="5" aria-describedby="desc-help"></textarea>
        <p id="desc-help" class="field-help">What will participants do or learn? Max 500 characters.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label for="duration">Session length <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
        <select id="duration" name="duration" required aria-required="true">
          <option value="">Select a duration&hellip;</option>
          <option value="30">30 minutes</option>
          <option value="60">60 minutes</option>
          <option value="90">90 minutes</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label for="sessionType">Session type (optional)</label>
        <input type="text" id="sessionType" name="sessionType" maxlength="100"
               placeholder="e.g. movement workshop, discussion, jam" autocomplete="off">
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label for="notes">Anything else we should know? (optional)</label>
        <textarea id="notes" name="notes" maxlength="500" rows="3"
                  aria-describedby="notes-help"></textarea>
        <p id="notes-help" class="field-help">Equipment needs, accessibility considerations, etc. Max 500 characters.</p>
      </div>
    </fieldset>

    <!-- Privacy notice -->
    <div class="privacy-notice" role="note" aria-label="Privacy notice">
      <h2>Privacy notice</h2>
      <p>We collect your name, email, and proposal details to coordinate the unconference schedule for Kin-Fusion Campout 2026. This information is shared only with the event organizing team and stored in a Google Sheet accessible to organizers. <strong>Personal data will be deleted by December&nbsp;12,&nbsp;2026</strong> (90 days after the event ends). To request early deletion or a copy of your data, email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Code of Conduct -->
    <div class="field consent-field">
      <label class="checkbox-label">
        <input type="checkbox" name="codeOfConductAccepted" id="codeOfConductAccepted"
               required aria-required="true" aria-describedby="coc-help">
        <span>I have read and accept the <a href="/code-of-conduct/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Kin-Fusion Code of Conduct</a>. <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></span>
      </label>
      <p id="coc-help" class="field-help">Required to submit a proposal.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Turnstile -->
    <div class="turnstile-container">
      <div class="cf-turnstile"
           data-sitekey="{{ site.turnstileSitekeyStaging if env == 'preview' else site.turnstileSitekey }}"
           data-callback="turnstileCallback"
           aria-label="Security challenge"></div>
      <p id="turnstile-fallback" hidden>
        Unable to load the security check. Please <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">email your proposal</a> instead.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div id="form-status" role="alert" aria-live="polite" class="form-status"></div>

    <button type="submit" id="submit-btn" class="btn btn-primary">Submit proposal</button>
  </form>
</div>

<script src="https://challenges.cloudflare.com/turnstile/v0/api.js" async defer></script>
<script type="module" src="/js/unconference.js"></script>
